Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; MapleNight config reset — wipes Wizet/MapleStory options from HKCU.
; Use when a user's resolution or other sysOpt is stuck due to stale values
; left by another v83-derived client (Royals/Heaven/etc — they all share
; HKCU\Software\Wizet\MapleStory because the injector hook redirects
; RegCreateKeyEx HKLM→HKCU).
;
; After running, relaunch MapleNight; all options revert to defaults.
; This does NOT touch character data or game files — only the registry
; subkey holding screen resolution / window positions / sysOpt flags.

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Wizet\MapleStory]
